sequenceDiagram
participant A as main
participant S as LocalAuthServer
participant V as MainWindow
participant H as HttpClient
A->>S: start() 监听 127.0.0.1 随机端口
alt 监听成功
S-->>A: endpoint()
A->>V: setLoginEndpoint(endpoint)
else 监听失败
A->>V: applyLoginState(启动失败)
end
H->>S: POST /auth/login (JSON)
S->>S: 异步累积请求，校验方法、路径、长度、JSON
alt 完整请求且 root / root 匹配
S-->>H: 200 token、用户、expiresIn
else 账号或密码错误
S-->>H: 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
else 无效协议、路径、方法或大小
S-->>H: 400 / 404 / 405 / 413
end
S->>S: 关闭连接并释放 socket
Note over S: 未完整接收等待后续数据；5 秒超时关闭；最多 16 个连接
